Subject: [PATCH 1/8] path3: port vision-only files + registry wiring onto SM80
 fork (step 1/5)

Copies vl_stub.py, nvidia/vl_model.py, common/mm_preprocess.py, and
common/vision.py unmodified from the pinned Vision head onto the proven
SM80 fork, plus the __init__.py/registry.py wiring to expose
DeepseekV4ForConditionalGeneration. py_compile and pyflakes pass; the
import/CPU-unit-test gate is deferred to the in-container build (step 3)
since vllm's platform bootstrap needs the compiled C extension on any
host with an NVIDIA driver. Steps 2-5 (model.py/attention/cache_utils
vision hunks, PP runner guard, build, boot, measure) not started.
